    "group": "Annihilation Legion",
    "summary": "Whenever one of your FLAYED ONES or DESTROYER CULT units declares a charge, you may re-roll its Charge roll, and if at least one of the charge's targets is Below Half-strength, that Charge roll also gets +1. When a DESTROYER CULT unit of yours shoots, each ranged attack aimed at the closest eligible target has its Armour Penetration improved by 1.",
